OL,3,GNEWSASecondary school teacher to
OL,4,Acrofter - life on the UK's most remote
OL,5,Aisland
OL,6,
OL,7,FKaty Phenix's new life as a crofter on
OL,8,Fthe UK's most remote inhabited island
OL,9,Fis a far cry from her previous life as
OL,10,Fa history teacher in a secondary
OL,11,Fschool.
OL,13,FThe 33-year-old relocated to Fair Isle
OL,14,Ffrom Redcar, North Yorkshire, with her
OL,15,Fpartner Josh Moore, 35, and their
OL,16,Fchildren Teddy, 11, and Hetty, six, in
OL,17,FJuly.
OL,19,FThey had never visited the island
OL,20,Fbefore moving there but were seeking
OL,21,Fmore family time and a better quality
OL,22,Fof life.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,425,420,260,160,0,100
